  "notes": [
    "Generic mid-engine hypercar; dimensions are class-typical, not a specific production car.",
    "Different wheel radii: front 0.347 m, rear 0.364 m; at rest the wheel centres are at z = r per axle.",
    "Rear wing: node wing_flap = main plane, chord 0.3 m, span 1.72 m, inverted NACA 4-digit (12 % thick, 6 % camber). Pivot = leading edge [-1.93, 0.0, 0.975] at rest (moves with wing_lift). Rest chord angle 8 deg trailing edge up (downforce). wing_flap range -8..+55 deg about the rest angle (-8 = flat/low drag, +55 = airbrake). wing_lift raises the whole wing 0..0.28 m along +z.",
    "Front flaps flap_front_L/R: chord 0.13 m, span 0.34 m each, leading edge x=2.31, |y|=0.6, z=0.128; rest chord angle 10 deg trailing edge up; range -10..+20 deg.",
    "Aero regions: node 'splitter' = front splitter plate (x 1.70..2.38, |y|<0.85, z=0.09); node 'diffuser' = rear diffuser ramp + 6 fins (underbody from x=-1.75, z=0.105 rising to z=0.33 at x=-2.35). Flat underbody at z=0.10 between them. Frontal area approx. 2.0 m^2.",
    "Butterfly doors: tilted hinge axis at the A-pillar base; door + mirror open together.",
    "Design A: sculpted silver body, concave door coves, enlarged side scoops, swept LED blades, dark canopy."
  ]
